Calorie based recommender
Mahdis Fruit Salad: 
Ingredients: apple:1, banana:1, lettuce:1 
Calories: 125
Steps:
Mahdis washes and cores fresh apples
Mahdi peels and slices ripe bananas
Elahe tears lettuce into bite-sized pieces
Amirali tosses all fruits together in large bowl
Kosar drizzles with honey and serves chilled
Paria Chicken Soup: 
Ingredients: chicken:1, carrot:1, potato:1, salt:1, pepper:1 
Calories: 310
Steps:
Paria washes and cuts chicken into pieces
Artin peels and dices carrots and potatoes
Amirreza boils chicken in large pot with vegetables
Mahdis seasons with salt and pepper to taste
Mahdi simmers for 45 minutes until tender and serves hot
Amirreza Beef Stew: 
Ingredients: beef:1, potato:1, carrot:1, tomato:1, salt:1 
Calories: 330
Steps:
Amirreza cuts beef into bite-sized cubes
Mahdis browns beef in hot oil until seared
Mahdi adds diced potatoes carrots and tomatoes
Elahe seasons with salt and covers pot
Amirali simmers stew for two hours until meat is tender
